          title: "Understood only afterward",
          body: "This is one of John’s honest asides: the disciples did **not** grasp the saying at the time — only *after* the resurrection did they “remember” and believe (cf. 12:16; 14:26, where the Spirit brings it all back). And notice what they believe: **the Scripture and the word that Jesus had spoken**, set side by side. Jesus’ own words already carry the weight of Scripture.",
